# merge into protected main. Everything else (component internals under /ingest,
# /maintenance, /api, /search, /ui) is routine and merges on green CI + a
# favorable reviewer-agent verdict.
#
# Replace @resource-engine/maintainers with the real GitHub team or handles.
# Spec: Requirements 5.1, 5.2, 5.3, 5.4.

# Architecture / contract surfaces (Req 5.1)
/contracts/**              @resource-engine/maintainers

# Infrastructure + IAM (Req 5.2)
/infra/**                  @resource-engine/maintainers

# CI + governance mechanics (Req 5.3)
/.github/workflows/**      @resource-engine/maintainers
/.github/CODEOWNERS        @resource-engine/maintainers

# Guardrails (Req 5.3)
/docs/agents-guardrails.md @resource-engine/maintainers

# Anything carrying secrets / data-handling config (Req 5.2)
**/secrets*                @resource-engine/maintainers
